OL,3,GNEWSA'We want fair government funding
OL,4,Afor hospices'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If it weren't for this place, I don't
OL,7,Fknow what I'd have done."
OL,9,FBrian Bowns is one of hundreds of
OL,10,Fpeople taking classes, learning and
OL,11,Fmaking new friends at St Luke's Hospice
OL,12,Fin Sheffield.
OL,14,FIt's a place determined to show people
OL,15,Fthat a terminal diagnosis doesn't have
OL,16,Fto be the end they imagine.
OL,18,FBut without better government funding,
OL,19,Fhospices in Yorkshire say they may have
OL,20,Fto close.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
